        "original_id": "d6a27f8c-c199-5c36-a01b-b88eb9020fba",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ralph Smart, Trey Parker, Eric Cartman, Matt Stone\n- Works: Danger Man, South Park\n- Roles: producer, director, writer, actor, animator, singer, songwriter, character voice\n\nFacts:\n- Ralph Foster Smart was born on 27 August 1908 and died on 12 February 2001.\n- Ralph Smart was a film and television producer, director, and writer who was born in England to Australian parents.\n- Ralph Smart created the programme Danger Man and wrote many of its scripts.\n- Randolph Severn \"Trey\" Parker III was born on October 19, 1969.\n- Trey Parker is an American actor, animator, writer, director, producer, singer, and songwriter.\n- Eric Theodore Cartman is a main character in the animated television series South Park.\n- South Park was created by Matt Stone and Trey Parker.\n- Trey Parker voices Eric Cartman.",
